{"id":"vod_bf_16260","vodId":"16260","provider":"bf","providerName":"暴风资源","type":2,"name":"极黑的布伦希尔特","name_cn":"极黑的布伦希尔特","date":"2014-01-01","year":"2014","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"完结","images":{"common":"https://p.bfvp26.com/upload/vod/20230424-17/1e6ad8b845687f0c59eba6ca4d846c42.jpg"},"summary":"学业优秀的高中二年级学生村上良太（逢坂良太 配音）是天文部唯一一名成员，童年时代他曾有过十分要好的朋友“黑猫”，但在一次事故中，少女黑猫为了营救良太而被宣告死亡。这起事件给了良太沉重的打击与创伤，因此他才希望代替黑猫仰望星空，找到传说中的外星人。这一天，美丽女孩黑羽宁子（种田梨沙 配音）转到良太的班级，他惊讶地发现，黑羽竟和黑猫长得极其相像。宁子是个奇怪神秘的女孩，她不会九九乘法，却能够预测他人的死期。她在暴雨中拯救了本该死去的良太，并向对方透露了其魔法使的身份。为了保护良太，宁子拒绝与之过多接触。然而好奇心十足且对过去抱着诸多疑问的良太，还是义无返顾闯入了一个神秘而危险的世界……　　本片根据冈本伦的原作改编。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"日本动画"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2026-06-10 04:25:27","playable":true,"episodeCount":13,"classic":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"bfzym3u8","episodes":[{"name":"第01集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiheidebulunxierte/第01集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiheidebulunxierte/第02集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiheidebulunxierte/第03集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiheidebulunxierte/第04集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiheidebulunxierte/第05集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiheidebulunxierte/第06集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiheidebulunxierte/第07集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiheidebulunxierte/第08集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiheidebulunxierte/第09集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiheidebulunxierte/第10集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiheidebulunxierte/第11集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiheidebulunxierte/第12集/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13集","url":"https://c1.ddbbffcdn.com/video/jiheidebulunxierte/第13集/i